{"title": "Failsafe Protocol", "pageid": 17728, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Failsafe_Protocol", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Explosion.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/48/Generic_Explosion.webp/300px-Generic_Explosion.webp, /w/images/4/48/Generic_Explosion.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/48/Generic_Explosion.webp/300px-Generic_Explosion.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/48/Generic_Explosion.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Failsafe Protocol</b> is a passive feature which grants a creature the ability to self-destruct in an explosion.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>After losing a significant amount of <a href=\"/wiki/Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hit Points\">Hit Points</a>, this creature will begin a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Self-Detonation_Protocol\" title=\"Self-Detonation Protocol\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Self-Detonation Protocol\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Self-Detonation_Protocol\" title=\"Self-Detonation Protocol\">Self-Detonation Protocol</a> to eliminate all nearby threats. If it dies, it instantly <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Self-Detonate\" title=\"Self-Detonate\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"detonates\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Self-Detonate\" title=\"Self-Detonate\">detonates</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Hellfire_Watcher\" title=\"Hellfire Watcher\">Hellfire Watcher</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Steel_Watcher_(creature)\" title=\"Steel Watcher (creature)\">Steel Watcher (creature)</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Self-Detonation_Protocol\" title=\"Self-Detonation Protocol\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Self-Detonation Protocol\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/dc/Generic_Explosion_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Self-Detonation_Protocol\" title=\"Self-Detonation Protocol\">Self-Detonation Protocol</a> applies the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Detonation_Impending!_(Condition)\" title=\"Detonation Impending! (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ec/Generic_Explosion_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Explosion_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ec/Generic_Explosion_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Generic_Explosion_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ec/Generic_Explosion_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Generic_Explosion_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Detonation Impending!\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ec/Generic_Explosion_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Generic_Explosion_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ec/Generic_Explosion_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Detonation_Impending!_(Condition)\" title=\"Detonation Impending! (Condition)\">Detonation Impending!</a> condition.\n</p>\n</div>     \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202925\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.040 seco